# Overgrown Farmland: with two or more other lands it enters untapped, and taps for either green or white (CR 106.5).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Overgrown Farmland
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Overgrown Farmland.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Overgrown Farmland.Activate(Color: White)
? Bot1.Mana = {W}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Overgrown Farmland.Activate(Color: Green)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Overgrown Farmland.Tapped = true
